    "text": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"ru\"><head><title>Senior UI/UX Designer</title></head><body><h1>Senior UI/UX Designer</h1><script type=\"application/json\" data-nuxt-data=\"nuxt-app\" data-ssr=\"true\" id=\"__NUXT_DATA__\">[[\"ShallowReactive\",1],{\"data\":2,\"state\":87},{\"vacancy-1328246-senior-ui-ux-designer-react\":3},{\"id\":4,\"slug\":5,\"title\":6,\"original_title\":7,\"company_title\":8,\"work_format\":9,\"remote_type\":11,\"work_type\":12,\"vacancy_language\":13,\"text\":14,\"is_archived\":15,\"created_at\":16,\"updated_at\":17,\"apply_url\":18,\"contacts_type\":19,\"tags\":21,\"salary\":52,\"specializations\":62,\"grades\":73,\"regions\":77,\"main_stack\":83},1328246,\"1328246-senior-ui-ux-designer-react\",\"Senior UI/UX Designer (React)\",\"Senior UI/UX Designer\",\"Bright Vision Technologies\",[10],\"remote\",\"usa\",\"fulltime\",\"en\",\"<p class=\\\"location\\\">Location: 100% remote within the United States; Overland Park, Kansas is also listed.</p><p class=\\\"salary\\\">Salary: $135,000–$155,000 annually.</p><h3 class=\\\"company-description\\\">Company</h3><p>Bright Vision Technologies is a technology consulting and software development company delivering cloud, AI, data, and enterprise solutions across the United States.</p><h3 class=\\\"what-you-will-do\\\">What you will do</h3><ul><li>Research, design, develop, and maintain enterprise-grade digital experiences for multiple business functions and user groups.</li><li>Translate business requirements into intuitive user experiences, visual designs, information architectures, and interactive prototypes.</li><li>Develop responsive, accessible, component-driven front-end interfaces and reusable design systems.</li><li>Conduct usability testing, accessibility validation, debugging, and design quality assurance.</li><li>Integrate front-end applications with RESTful APIs, cloud-hosted applications, authentication systems, and deployment environments.</li><li>Collaborate with product managers, business analysts, software engineers, QA teams, and stakeholders in an Agile environment.</li></ul><h3 class=\\\"requirements\\\">Requirements</h3><ul><li><strong>Bachelor’s degree</strong> in Human-Computer Interaction, Graphic Design, Computer Science, Information Technology, Digital Media, or a closely related discipline.</li><li><strong>Five or more years of professional experience</strong> designing and developing production-grade web or mobile applications with a strong focus on user experience and interface design.</li><li>Strong understanding of user-centered design methodologies, information architecture, interaction design, accessibility standards, responsive design, and end-to-end product design processes.</li><li>Advanced working knowledge of Figma, Adobe XD, Sketch, Photoshop, Illustrator, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, TypeScript, and modern front-end frameworks such as React.</li><li>Hands-on experience creating responsive interfaces, interactive prototypes, reusable design systems, component libraries, and scalable front-end architectures.</li><li>Proven experience developing front-end applications with React.</li><li>Knowledge of responsive web design, CSS frameworks, browser compatibility, WCAG accessibility, front-end optimization, and UI performance best practices.</li></ul>\",false,\"2026-10-28T00:47:24.000000Z\",\"2026-10-28T00:47:27.000000Z\",null,[20],\"url\",[22,25,28,31,34,37,40,43,46,49],{\"id\":23,\"name\":24},31,\"figma\",{\"id\":26,\"name\":27},103,\"javascript\",{\"id\":29,\"name\":30},119,\"typescript\",{\"id\":32,\"name\":33},189,\"rest api\",{\"id\":35,\"name\":36},211,\"html\",{\"id\":38,\"name\":39},481,\"css\",{\"id\":41,\"name\":42},2014,\"react\",{\"id\":44,\"name\":45},2150,\"accessibility\",{\"id\":47,\"name\":48},2458,\"ui ux design\",{\"id\":50,\"name\":51},3939,\"responsive design\",{\"id\":53,\"vacancy_id\":54,\"currency\":55,\"salary_period\":56,\"min\":57,\"max\":58,\"salary_in_usd\":59,\"created_at\":60,\"updated_at\":61},5